// Display definition for the universal creative ammunition item.
//
// "render": "item" selects the conventional 2D Minecraft item mode: the item is drawn by Minecraft's normal
// item model path, using the baked model of the item id in "item_model". No Bedrock geometry, no texture and
// no custom renderer is involved, so this document needs no artwork of its own.
//
// "item_model" may name any item whose baked model exists (a vanilla item, or an item from a normally mounted
// resource pack). Replace it to give this ammunition a different icon; nothing else has to change.
{
  "render": "item",
  "item_model": "minecraft:gunpowder"
}
